** Data transfer from Discord **

You can transfer your data from Discord. Follow the short instructions:

1. Go to ** Discord ** settings;  
2. Open the section ** data and confidentiality **;  
3. Press ** Request all my data **;  
4. Mark the necessary points and confirm.

After a few weeks (up to a month) you will receive an archive `.zip` with your data. Download the archive and ** load it entirely without changes ** into this team. The bot will process the data and report when everything is ready.

> ⚠️ Currently preserved ** only your messages **.  
> ⚠️ ** Most of the current data in the bot will be deleted after transfer! **

